{"3994680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meat Grinder: Hotdog Simulator", "steam_appid": 3994680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/a0fa6a116f36fa2f9da1529332669469.avif?t=1786792119\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras_big/a0fa6a116f36fa2f9da1529332669469.webp?t=1786792119 width=1560 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Grimshore. Please mind the smell.</strong> You opened your very own hot dog shop, and the customers keep coming. There's just one small business problem: demand is high, and meat runs out fast. Luckily, the foggy little town of Grimshore has no shortage of raw material, if you're not too fussy about where it comes from. Meat Grinder is a first-person simulation with a rotten heart. Run an honest hot dog stand by day, take care of your supply chain by night, and try not to think too hard about the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/3c0303c36facbf73c0718d741251692d.poster.avif?t=1786792119\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/3c0303c36facbf73c0718d741251692d.webm?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/3c0303c36facbf73c0718d741251692d.mp4?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the shop</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill the sausages, slice the buns, fry the potatoes, squirt the sauce, wrap it up, and hand it over with a smile. Keep customers happy, keep the money coming, and reinvest in your growing fast food empire. It's a cozy little cooking routine, right up until you run out of stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/7999f3e8c938d6812d92746f9b77f961.poster.avif?t=1786792119\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/7999f3e8c938d6812d92746f9b77f961.webm?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/7999f3e8c938d6812d92746f9b77f961.mp4?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve your supply problem</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the freezer runs dry, the beef carcasses can only cover so much. Grimshore's graveyard is quiet, the tools are cheap, and the meat grinder doesn't ask questions. Head out after dark, source some fresh ingredients, and get them back to the shop before opening time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/69bb75fd4820d191fff118732c79d385.poster.avif?t=1786792119\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/69bb75fd4820d191fff118732c79d385.webm?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/69bb75fd4820d191fff118732c79d385.mp4?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the town's secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the fog and the frying oil, Grimshore has stories it would rather keep buried. Take on side quests, meet the locals, follow the threads, and dig into your own character's past, whether or not you like what you find down there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/386ad36a631203203291416fccf7b6f3.poster.avif?t=1786792119\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/386ad36a631203203291416fccf7b6f3.webm?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/386ad36a631203203291416fccf7b6f3.mp4?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooked in glorious low-poly</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi retro visuals, chunky textures, and a grimy nostalgic atmosphere give the whole town that unsettling old-school horror feel. Comfort food has never looked so uncomfortable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a hot dog shop: cook, serve, and manage customers in a hands-on first-person kitchen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock by any means necessary: when the meat runs out, get creative after dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark open world: explore the foggy town of Grimshore and its unsettling corners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and night loop: honest food service by day, questionable errands by night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story to uncover: side quests that reveal the town's secrets, and a main story digging into your character's past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden areas and secrets tucked away for players who go looking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro low-poly graphics and a nostalgic old-school horror atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Grimshore. Please mind the smell.</strong> You opened your very own hot dog shop, and the customers keep coming. There's just one small business problem: demand is high, and meat runs out fast. Luckily, the foggy little town of Grimshore has no shortage of raw material, if you're not too fussy about where it comes from. Meat Grinder is a first-person simulation with a rotten heart. Run an honest hot dog stand by day, take care of your supply chain by night, and try not to think too hard about the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/3c0303c36facbf73c0718d741251692d.poster.avif?t=1786792119\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/3c0303c36facbf73c0718d741251692d.webm?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/3c0303c36facbf73c0718d741251692d.mp4?t=1786792119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the shop</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill the sausages, slice the buns, fry the potatoes, squirt the sauce, wrap it up, and hand it over with a smile. Keep customers happy, keep the money coming, and reinvest in your growing fast food empire. It's a cozy little cooking routine, right up until you run out of stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994680/extras/7999f3e8c938d6812d92746f9b77f961.poster.avif?t=1786792119\" width=1170 heig